I go into the kitchen behind Priya.
The kitchen is very clean and beautiful.
There is a very good smell of food in the air.
I ask Priya, "How can I help you?"
Priya gives me some plates.
She smiles and says, "Come on, let's set the table first."
I say, "Okay, I will set the plates."
We go to the dining room.
I put the plates on the table.
Priya brings the spoons and forks.
We also place the water glasses.
While working, we talk comfortably.
Priya asks me about the office.
I tell her that everything is going fine.
We laugh about office matters.
Now we are not just colleagues.
I think that we will become good friends.
This is our first meeting outside the office.
I think that this evening will be very fun.
